Feature: Loop's conformance tests run in parallel
  Independent tests of ./conformance call t.Parallel; only tests that share a process-wide or
  per-test mutable resource stay sequential. Every one of the 216 tests the package ran before
  the change (79 top-level tests and their subtests, names from an uncached go test -json run
  of eaea000) still runs and passes. Names are compared with any t.TempDir path in a test name
  replaced by <TempDir>; the conformance package has no such name today.

